msgstr "Woo FB Tracking Server-Side nécessite que WooCommerce soit installé et activé."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:172
msgid "Setup Guide & Instructions"
msgstr "Guide de configuration & Tutoriel"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:268
msgid "Send anonymized request (Default & Recommended - No PII, no _fbp/_fbc, no IP/User-Agent)"
msgstr "Envoyer une requête anonymisée (Par défaut & Recommandé — Sans PII, sans _fbp/_fbc, sans IP/User-Agent)"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:269
msgid "Safely sends order value, currency, contents, and eventID for statistical aggregation without customer personal data."
msgstr "Transmet en toute sécurité le montant, la devise, les articles commandés et l'eventID pour l'agrégation statistique sans aucune donnée personnelle du client."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:273
msgid "Cancel CAPI request completely (Strict CNIL)"
msgstr "Annuler totalement la requête CAPI (Strict CNIL)"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:274
msgid "Completely cancels and ignores CAPI transmission if marketing consent is refused."
msgstr "Annule et ignore totalement la transmission CAPI si le consentement marketing est refusé."

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:592
msgid "Step-by-Step Meta Hybrid Tracking Setup Guide"
msgstr "Guide pas à pas de configuration du suivi hybride Meta"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:613
msgid "Open Meta Events Manager"
msgstr "Ouvrir le Gestionnaire d'événements Meta"

#: includes/class-wfbt-admin-settings.php:617
